  "question": {
    "text": "A board has 16 squares as shown in the figure:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.quizrr.in/question-assets/jee_main_pyq/Yfw6kJOWsbLAtJOMXpdUSvYyuAwAQxSZUaTpULCAaas.original.fullsize.png\">\r\nOut of these 16 squares, two squares are chosen at random. The probability that they have no side in common is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
